WEBVTT

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.680
KUJO

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.930
Thank you so much
for coming today.

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.150
This is our daughter, Asuna.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.340
Thank you for your invitation.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:46.310
May I introduce
my nephew, Shun?

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.390
I'm so glad that
the weather is so fine today.

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.200
Shun, how about a greeting?

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:58.600
O-Oh, yes.
My name is Shun Mitaka.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.340
My name is Asuna Kujo.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.440
Coach Mitaka must be in
his marriage meeting right now.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.460
I guess so.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:28.190
Her family's loaded,
and she was cute, too, huh?

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:39.500
You're the only one
who could stop me.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:02.930
You've never had a boyfriend?

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:06.370
I attended girls' schools
all my life.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.780
I find that hard to believe.
Why, you're so charming.

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.650
I'm a bit of an introvert.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:18.590
I'd rather stay home
and play with my siblings.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.720
I'm the complete opposite.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:27.090
I love the outdoors...
playing sports.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:31.030
I'll do whatever it takes!

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:34.400
H-Huh? You really don't--

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:40.370
Um... Would you mind
meeting my brothers?

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:42.610
I would love you to meet them.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.840
Sure. Of course.

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:46.650
They would be elated!

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:56.020
I can't believe such
a nice girl still exists.

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.880
She's a little too quiet
for my taste...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.150
but I guess that's
part of her charm--

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:06.620
Hey? I thought
she's an only child...?

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.460
I'm sorry to keep you waiting!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.740
These are my brothers.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:18.700
Remember? This is the man
I told you about yesterday.

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:20.610
Say hello.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:38.690
I wonder how his
marriage meeting went?

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:03.990
Don't you think it's weird?

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.160
What is?

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.310
You'd think Coach Mitaka
would call you...

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:11.510
as soon as the meeting
was over.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:15.950
Maybe they went for a nice drive.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.930
Or maybe they're having lunch.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.320
I guess.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.860
Hello? This is Otonashi.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.180
Coach Mitaka?

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.620
Is that you?

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.620
I'm sorry for not
contacting you right away.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.290
I wanted
to call you sooner...

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:50.300
but I suddenly felt ill.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.190
But not to worry. I don't
think I'll see her again.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.610
No?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.110
But she sounded so perfect.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:07.990
W-We have different interests.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.050
I see.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.520
And most importantly...

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.800
I plan to turn her down
for you.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:17.510
Oh...

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.060
Bye.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:33.810
Oh, boy. Back to the same ol', huh?

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.790
Hello? It's Maison Ikkoku.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.060
Kozue?

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:50.450
Urgent?

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:55.300
Sure. I'll be there.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.890
You don't have to
whisper like that.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:07.130
Can you really do it?

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.920
I'm sure he'll be fine!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:12.350
Godai?

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.120
Y-Yes!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.160
I brought some tea.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.000
Thank you.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.080
Manager, Big Brother Godai's
gonna be a preschool teacher.

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.170
Preschool...

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.060
teacher?

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.690
Kozue's friend was working
there part-time, but she's leaving.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:34.260
So they asked me.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.000
Don't you think it's
a perfect job for Godai?

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.110
You've got connections everywhere.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.910
Your students love you.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:50.060
Yeah. From high-school girls in bloomers
to babies in diapers.

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:52.790
You have a huge repertoire.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.730
W-What are you talking about?!

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.430
What high-school girls?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:07:59.860
Since you asked--!!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:00.950
Yotsuya!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.320
I believe I haven't yet
received your last month's rent.

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.180
Am I wrong?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.180
Let's see... What was
I just talking about?

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.930
I've become so senile lately.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.410
This is not good.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.570
Good luck, Godai.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.290
But what about school?

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:24.360
Now that I'm a senior
I have only two classes a week.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.880
Besides, they told me I don't
have to work when I have classes.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.430
It's decided, then!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.650
Let's celebrate!

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:34.860
That's my--

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:36.650
Yeah!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.870
All right!
I'm going to skip work!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.660
Drink up! This is on Godai!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.450
Let me know when
you need a refill!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.720
You know--

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.870
Please! You're going to be
earning money soon, aren't you?

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.720
Oh, jeez.

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.720
Let's party!

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:58.490
Yeah!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:08:59.720
Cheers!

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.650
I wonder if there's something
wrong with Mitaka's health?

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.840
He suffered convulsions
during our meeting.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.350
What do you think, Asuna?

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.080
Shall we turn him down?

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.740
I...I've made up my mind.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.820
These little ones
are very particular...

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:27.170
yet they fell
in love with him.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:29.750
He...

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:32.550
He is the one.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:36.020
And a few days later...

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:42.520
Our new part-timer is great.

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:44.200
He sure is a big help.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.490
Excuse me.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.890
Is there a Kyoko Otonashi
living here?

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:09.730
Otonashi?

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:12.550
--You mean the Manager?
--Yes.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.480
What's she done?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:21.480
I have a few questions I'd
like to ask about Ms. Otonashi.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.130
Who're you?

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.520
Oginishi Investigation Services
Yusaku Harada
You're from an
investigations agency?

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.540
Oginishi Investigation Services
Yusaku Harada

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:36.050
I'm a detective.

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.420
Detective?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.460
What's up, Akemi?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.830
This guy wants to know
about the Manager.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.070
I know! I bet you were
hired by the Kujo family

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.530
to find out the scoops
on Coach Mitaka, right?!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:57.500
Sure! Ask us anything
you want about the Manager.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:02.300
Let's go somewhere
we can relax and talk!

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:03.140
Huh?!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:05.580
Okay, then!

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.540
Let's go!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.720
Ma! What about dinner?

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.860
Eat instant ramen!

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:21.790
A detective?

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:25.740
All right.
I'll be right there.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.530
We'll be waitin' for ya!

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:57.110
Hey, you!
You haven't had a drop!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.430
When are you gonna loosen up?

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:04.150
Wow! What a change when
you take off your shades!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:08.560
C-Can we talk now
about Mitaka and Ms. Otonashi?

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:11.120
There's nothing between them!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:13.040
Ow!

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:14.830
No need to get
so short with this guy.

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:17.730
The table has
turned in your favor.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:19.550
What do you mean?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:24.550
If he wants to know what's up between
Coach Mitaka and the Manager...

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.780
it must mean that
the girl is interested.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:31.650
Don't worry.
We'll tell you everything.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:37.050
If you want information,
though, you mustn't be stingy.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.590
Refill, please!

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.290
Another bottle here!

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:52.460
Uncle, please.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.820
This relationship won't work.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.600
Says who?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:01.870
She's fallen madly
in love with you.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:04.150
She wants to pursue
this relationship.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.800
She comes from a very good family,
graduated from a top university...

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:10.430
she's good-natured,
young, and beautiful.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:12.560
That's not the problem!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.300
T-That dog-lover...!!

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.840
Asuna, are you listening to me?

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:30.570
We had a detective agency
look into his background.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:34.210
It seems he's been
quite a playboy.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:38.700
We hear he's even seeing
a woman from the tennis club now.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:42.980
Apparently, she's a young widow...

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.450
and Mitaka is the one who's
aggressively pursuing her.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:49.400
Sounds like a
thorough investigation.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:54.070
Of course. Those detectives
are professionals.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.490
I don't know what the
relationship is, exactly, but...

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:02.400
this is a concern.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.450
But...

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:08.740
If dogs love him so much,
he can't possibly be a bad man.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.820
And, if I ask that woman
with all my heart...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.800
to please break it off
with Mitaka, I'm sure she would.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:24.770
Bye!

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.600
Have a nice day!

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.540
He's a ball of energy.

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:33.970
He must love his preschool job.

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.210
He doesn't have
to use his brain.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:40.210
He just has to play
with kids all day.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:43.340
I-I think there's
more to it than that!

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.740
I'm sure it's
psychologically draining.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.250
You think?

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:54.560
Manager, are you lonely that Godai's
not around to give you attention?

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.490
I'm not--

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:00.070
Well, I'm off to the beauty shop.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:04.360
Open-class day
at Kentaro's school.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:08.440
What's wrong with me
going to a beauty shop?

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.370
Th-That's not what I--

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.100
I'm gonna look hot.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:17.450
Kentaro! Get up!
You'll be late for school!

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:24.060
He leaves early in the morning
and comes home late.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:28.720
I barely see Godai nowadays.

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:39.530
Going out?

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:40.830
Yeah.

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:41.810
Have a good day!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.690
Soichiro! Wait!

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:26.430
What's the matter, Soichiro?

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:33.820
I wonder whose dog this is?

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.090
I'm sorry!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.460
I'm sorry!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:41.140
Oh. Is this your dog?

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:42.140
Yes.

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:46.900
My! What a cute doggy you are!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.440
Thank you.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:51.320
What is his name?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.690
Soichiro.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.050
How fabulous.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.680
Do you like dogs?

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:01.980
I love them.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.660
Oh, Salad!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:06.440
This one is really particular.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:09.930
He usually doesn't like strangers.

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.360
ls that right?

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:16.680
You must be a wonderful person.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.260
Why, thank you.
Well...goodbye.

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:23.450
Um--

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.310
Yes?

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:30.420
Um... I... Um...

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:36.360
It's nothing.
Have a nice day.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.850
What was that all about?

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.450
I couldn't say it.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.590
I couldn't ask her
to break up with Mitaka.

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:19.750
But I'm glad to know
she loves dogs.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:24.760
She must be a very
understanding person.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.620
Did someone ask you, too?

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:34.040
You, too?

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:36.590
From a detective agency, right?

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.010
A detective agency?

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.620
He asked about Coach Mitaka.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:42.040
I knew it.

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.660
Remember? Coach Mitaka
was set up for marriage?

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.170
I bet the woman's family
hired the detective.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.560
Detective?

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.290
That's strange. Coach Mitaka
said he's turning her down.

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:15.860
Everyone knows now. Rather
than making up dumb excuses--

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:26.760
Mr. Godai! I gotta pee!

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:28.940
Hold it! Hold it!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.050
Godai!

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.270
Just a sec!

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.880
Don't leak!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.770
How's it going?

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.190
Okay, I guess.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:45.310
I never imagined it takes
so much stamina to play with kids.

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:48.250
I'm totally beat by evening.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:49.660
Don't you have school?

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.920
Just morning classes today.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.790
How about a movie tonight?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.670
My friend gave me tickets.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:02.110
They expire today!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.530
Uh... Sure.

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:08.770
Yay! I'll help you out
until evening.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.000
Hi kids!

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:13.650
I'm going to make
a house for you!

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:17.000
Who wants to help me?!

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.870
The rumors are true.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.450
The woman I met wants
to pursue the relationship.

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.620
I see.

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:46.970
Her family is one of
my uncle's best clients.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.210
So it's hard for us
to turn her down.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.970
Stop here!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:55.310
I want to stop by
a supermarket near here.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.160
All right.

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:08.400
Ms. Otonashi!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.510
Like I told you on
the phone the other day...

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:21.610
I'm turning her down
no matter what...

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:23.750
for you.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:31.370
This experience has
made me more determined.

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:36.760
You're the one I want to marry.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:41.460
I want to know
how you really feel.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:45.270
This is so sudden. I--

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:46.940
I'll wait one week.

00:21:47.810 --> 00:21:49.910
Please give me an answer
one week from today.

00:21:50.090 --> 00:21:51.470
B-But--

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:56.740
If your answer is "no,"
I'll disappear from your life.

00:22:02.730 --> 00:22:05.220
I'll be waiting!
One week!

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:18.170
One week...

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:42.840
What'll I do?

00:22:55.090 --> 00:22:58.350
What a great love story that was.

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:03.590
By the way... Are you hungry?

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:05.710
Shall we grab something to eat?

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:06.740
Yes!

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:15.950
I'll be waiting!
One week!

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:25.030
If your answer is "no,"
I'll disappear From your life.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:33.970
Eleven o'clock.

00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:41.310
Godai's really late.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:49.620
Godai stayed out all night?

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:51.700
What an idiot!

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:53.980
The Manager was up
waiting all night.

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:55.650
That was a deciding factor.

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:59.550
Next: "Godai or Mitaka?
The Moment of Truth!"

00:24:00.340 --> 00:24:01.830
Maybe I'll just get married!
